      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "RED metrics from the apps' own `http_server_request_duration_seconds` histogram and `http_server_active_requests` gauge (contract metrics; every app we write exports them on port 9464). Click a dot on the latency graph to open its trace (exemplar). Links above: traces and logs for the selected app."
